{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "TiQR Store APIs (Whatomate Flow Node)",
    "description": "MCP tools used by the Whatomate chatbot **TiQR Store** flow node (`tiqr_store_api`).\n\nWhatomate does not call buyer REST directly for this node \u2014 it invokes the tiqr-buyer MCP server (`tools/call`) with credentials from Chatbot \u2192 AI settings (`ai_commerce_mcp_url`, `ai_commerce_mcp_api_key`, `ai_commerce_store_id`).\n\n**Setup**\n1. Set collection variables: `mcp_base_url` (no trailing slash), `mcp_api_key`, `store_id`, and the sample IDs you need.\n2. Endpoint path is `/mcp` (streamable HTTP, `stateless_http=True`).\n3. Optional: send `initialize` first if your MCP gateway requires a session.\n\nFlow operation labels match the Whatomate palette dropdown in `tiqrStoreApiCatalog.ts`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
